<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88532" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαναγράφω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[γρᾰ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>record</i> or <i>enter besides,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.140.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				448.71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12(8).51.8
			</span></i> (Imbros, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PIand.</u>
				27.5
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">i/ii A.D.</span>, 
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.243a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Macr.</u>
				9
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαναγραφέντες προδόται εἰς ταύτην
					τὴν στήλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lycurg.
					118
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prescribe as well</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Geom.,
				<i>complete the tracing of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euc.
					3.25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαναγραψάμεναι τὰ λοιπὰ τοῦ
				χρωτός</span>
			<i>by tattooing</i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1960.16
			</span></i>) <i>in addition</i> the rest of <i>their</i> skin, <i><span class="en">
				Clearch.
				8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
